This is a single-fold, single-seed representation screen. It cannot establish
seasonal robustness, transfer, or a champion. A passing exponent would retain
its exact value for the unchanged three-fold/three-seed protocol. Three failed
interventions close this fixed power-law family and do not authorize exponent
retuning or confirmation release.

